# --- GDExtension (Phase 9) ---------------------------------------------------
# Vendored dependency: cloned, never committed. See extension/STEP0.md for the
# pinned commit -- that is what makes the build reproducible, not a checked-in copy.
extension/godot-cpp/
# SCons intermediates and the compiled library. bin/ is a build output directory;
# the .gdextension file points at it, and it is rebuilt per platform per target.
extension/.sconsign.dblite
extension/**/*.o
extension/**/*.os
extension/**/*.obj
bin/
